{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p>### 26-1. Ganthaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21204.325896866485\">5:53:24</span>  1. Noganthaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nogantho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21214.66734004387\">5:53:34</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21219.56664995613\">5:53:39</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21224.61022587984\">5:53:44</span> 3. Ganthaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ganthaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nogantho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ganthaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho akusalo ca nogantho akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-42a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21249.79681100763\">5:54:09</span> Noganthaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nogantho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Ganthaṃ akusalañca noganthaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21257.6064348703\">5:54:17</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-4</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21277.52090191417\">5:54:37</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21284.270539061035\">5:54:44</span> 5. Gantho akusalo dhammo ganthassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21294.207414017164\">5:54:54</span> 6. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21299.730093785423\">5:54:59</span> 7. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21303.180065094413\">5:55:03</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21306.47615480259\">5:55:06</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21309.865595768257\">5:55:09</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21322.434947145914\">5:55:22</span> 8. Noganthaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nogantho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21334.987230011444\">5:55:34</span> 9. Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42a-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21338.606065071526\">5:55:38</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 27-1. Ganthaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21343.397088851227\">5:55:43</span> 10. Ganthaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-42c-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21350.608237957083\">5:55:50</span> Aganthaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aganthaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21358.11505508297\">5:55:58</span> 11. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ, lokiyalokuttaragamanasadisaṃ). ^7-42c-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21361.770206037192\">5:56:01</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21365.264304\">5:56:05</span> 12. Ganthaniyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42c-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21377.525543068663\">5:56:17</span> 13. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42c-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21383.530806211715\">5:56:23</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21387.778042951362\">5:56:27</span> 14. Ganthaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-42c-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21396.56146404864\">5:56:36</span> Aganthaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21409.98901097711\">5:56:49</span> Ganthaniyaṃ abyākatañca aganthaniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21421.144794240325\">5:57:01</span> 15. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, lokiyalokuttaragamanasadisaṃ). ^7-42c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21430.516379736786\">5:57:10</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 28-1. Ganthasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21434.478006011443\">5:57:14</span> 16. Ganthavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21443.615158034332\">5:57:23</span> 17. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21448.59790382834\">5:57:28</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21453.38543599142\">5:57:33</span> 18. Ganthasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-42e-18</p><p><br /></p><p>Ganthavippayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… dve.</p><p><br /></p><p>Ganthasampayuttaṃ akusalañca ganthavippayuttaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21463.564788985695\">5:57:43</span> 19. Hetuyā cha, ārammaṇe cha, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21469.340056668123\">5:57:49</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā cha, napurejāte cha…pe… nakamme cattāri, navippayutte cha (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21479.06402174823\">5:57:59</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21484.387781045778\">5:58:04</span> 20. Ganthasampayutto akusalo dhammo ganthasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21496.79209487984\">5:58:16</span> 21. Hetuyā cha, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, sahajāte cha…pe… nissaye cha, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme cattāri…pe… magge cattāri, sampayutte cha…pe… avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21513.23877713733\">5:58:33</span> 22. Ganthavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21522.963495934197\">5:58:42</span> 23. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42e-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21527.86535992275\">5:58:47</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 29-1. Ganthaganthaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21532.893978042914\">5:58:52</span> 24. Ganthaniyañceva no ca ganthaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo ceva no ca gantho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-42g-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21544.107582991415\">5:59:04</span> 25. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ. ^7-42g-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21549.678808326156\">5:59:09</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21554.4393680515\">5:59:14</span> 26. Ganthañceva ganthaniyañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho ceva ganthaniyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-42g-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21566.011963982834\">5:59:26</span> Ganthaniyañceva no ca ganthaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo ceva no ca gantho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Ganthañceva ganthaniyaṃ akusalañca ganthaniyañceva no ca ganthaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho ceva ganthaniyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21577.469767188828\">5:59:37</span> 27. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21583.245208040054\">5:59:43</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi…pe… navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21587.240935814032\">5:59:47</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21596.33697969387\">5:59:56</span> 28. Gantho ceva ganthaniyo ca akusalo dhammo ganthassa ceva ganthaniyassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21608.489185008584\">6:00:08</span> 29. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21613.336217931337\">6:00:13</span> 30. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21616.97911624605\">6:00:16</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21620.540058174523\">6:00:20</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21623.343949317572\">6:00:23</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21636.408629799727\">6:00:36</span> 31. Ganthaniyañceva no ca ganthaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthaniyo ceva no ca gantho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21651.53533897139\">6:00:51</span> 32. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42g-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21656.94191014019\">6:00:56</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 30-1. Ganthaganthasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21662.21527897139\">6:01:02</span> 33. Ganthañceva ganthasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho ceva ganthasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42i-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21673.69398824891\">6:01:13</span> 34. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42i-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21678.160088031473\">6:01:18</span> Naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, nakamme tīṇi…pe… navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21682.26371602003\">6:01:22</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21687.06903577398\">6:01:27</span> 35. Gantho ceva ganthasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo ganthassa ceva ganthasampayuttassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42i-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21698.2717218312\">6:01:38</span> 36. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42i-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21702.658927931334\">6:01:42</span> 37. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42i-37</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21706.49507399428\">6:01:46</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21710.02041588842\">6:01:50</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21713.474519845506\">6:01:53</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 31-1. Ganthavippayuttaganthaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-42j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-42k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21726.455203739646\">6:02:06</span> 38. Ganthavippayuttaṃ ganthaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto ganthaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-42k-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21740.59354308583\">6:02:20</span> Ganthavippayuttaṃ aganthaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto aganthaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21751.43107890845\">6:02:31</span> 39. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42k-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21755.876522062943\">6:02:35</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21761.59853897997\">6:02:41</span> 40. Ganthavippayuttaṃ ganthaniyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto ganthaniyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42k-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21773.626123991417\">6:02:53</span> 41. Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42k-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21777.44710991417\">6:02:57</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21782.160249045777\">6:03:02</span> 42. Ganthavippayuttaṃ ganthaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto ganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-42k-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21794.423575005723\">6:03:14</span> Ganthavippayuttaṃ aganthaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto aganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21806.94140625463\">6:03:26</span> Ganthavippayuttaṃ ganthaniyaṃ abyākatañca ganthavippayuttaṃ aganthaniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ganthavippayutto ganthaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21823.14713324891\">6:03:43</span> 43. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42k-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21829.02570703719\">6:03:49</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21834.933733928476\">6:03:54</span> 44. Ganthavippayutto ganthaniyo abyākato dhammo ganthavippayuttassa ganthaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-42k-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21846.469073753953\">6:04:06</span> Ganthavippayutto aganthaniyo abyākato dhammo ganthavippayuttassa aganthaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21859.61094391703\">6:04:19</span> 45. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā cattāri…pe… avigate satta. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-42k-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21871.35041486553\">6:04:31</span> 46. Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-42k-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21875.134989899863\">6:04:35</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21878.683350985695\">6:04:38</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21882.684004077248\">6:04:42</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Ganthagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Oghagocchakampi yogagocchakampi āsavagocchakakusalattikasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":21898.864849}